https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20678 Same mechanism as #20644

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend920_db7_join_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend920_db7_join_min;
USE repro_databend920_db7_join_min;

SET enable_query_result_cache = 0;

CREATE TABLE s (id BIGINT NOT NULL, f DOUBLE NULL) ENGINE = MEMORY;
CREATE TABLE l (id BIGINT NOT NULL, f DOUBLE NULL) ENGINE = MEMORY;
CREATE TABLE r (id BIGINT NOT NULL) ENGINE = FUSE;

INSERT INTO s VALUES (1, 1.0), (2, NULL);
INSERT INTO l VALUES (1, 1.0), (2, NULL);
INSERT INTO r VALUES (1), (2);

-- 单表：实际结果 1
SELECT SUM(id)
FROM s
WHERE NOT (f NOT IN (f));

单表：
TableScan(s)
  push downs: is_true(CAST(s.b AS Float64 NULL) = s.a)
→ EvalScalar → Sort


-- 多表：实际结果 3，错误地包含 id=2 的 NULL 行
SELECT SUM(x.id)
FROM (
    SELECT l.id, l.f
    FROM l JOIN r ON l.id = r.id
) x
WHERE NOT (x.f NOT IN (x.f));

单表：1
多表：3

单表执行计划保留 Filter: is_true(s.f = s.f)；多表计划是 TableScan(l) → HashJoin(r) → Aggregate，没有该过滤，而且扫描 l 时只读取 id。把多表条件改成 WHERE x.f IS NOT NULL，实际结果恢复为 1。